 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.971,
   "end": 2.512,
   "text": "is the exact same."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.532,
   "end": 11.834,
   "text": "We saw with COVID, it was glaringly obvious that something's broken and something needs to change, but what do we do?"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.894,
   "end": 19.476,
   "text": "We've moved it online and now everyone's back to in-person like it never happened."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.696,
   "end": 21.736,
   "text": "Remote work is ending."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.436,
   "end": 26.837,
   "text": "We all saw that that could have changed and now they're going back because there's a fear in losing just like"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.495,
   "end": 33.869,
   "text": "publishing and music, there's a fear in losing that control over those gates."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.732,
   "end": 35.574,
   "text": "I want to plug..."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.763,
   "end": 40.464,
   "text": "a book from one of my clients called, she called it, What Is School For?"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.484,
   "end": 43.405,
   "text": "It's by Jessica Zoe."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.125,
   "end": 46.586,
   "text": "And it's all of this that you're saying."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.666,
   "end": 49.347,
   "text": "First of all, so that book is excellent."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.827,
   "end": 59.45,
   "text": "Second, you are with this podcast and this space, bringing experts together to teach them the thing that school didn't teach them, which is how to question everything."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.05,
   "end": 62.991,
   "text": "That's the biggest thing they're missing in school is how to learn."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.151,
   "end": 66.012,
   "text": "They're learning how to study, which is what Jessica talked about."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.032,
   "end": 67.212,
   "text": "They're learning how to study."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.292,
   "end": 68.732,
   "text": "They're learning how to follow rules."
  },
  {
   "start": 68.792,
   "end": 70.453,
   "text": "They're learning how to fall in line."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.973,
   "end": 75.634,
   "text": "They're learning how to be there for way too many hours when it's hard."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.814,
   "end": 83.036,
   "text": "And then also do stuff after and find fulfillment outside of school because you're going to have to find fulfillment outside of work."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.056,
   "end": 88.458,
   "text": "They're learning all of that stuff, but they're not learning curiosity and how to follow it."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.618,
   "end": 89.598,
   "text": "And they're not learning how to"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.995,
   "end": 94.958,
   "text": "be learners and questioning everything is where that happens."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.018,
   "end": 100.101,
   "text": "So this goes back to not everything has to be a book to be like, to get the gold stars."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.661,
   "end": 102.502,
   "text": "You start in what you're doing."
  },
  {
   "start": 103.349,
   "end": 103.629,
   "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
   "start": 104.23,
   "end": 107.452,
   "text": "And then you can, if the book comes next, fabulous."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.092,
   "end": 109.953,
   "text": "If the event comes next, great."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.253,
   "end": 114.356,
   "text": "Like whatever it is that it grows into is totally legitimate."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.396,
   "end": 118.898,
   "text": "There's no prescribed way that you have to go to be like, I have to make the book happen first."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.058,
   "end": 121.06,
   "text": "It's the same thing as the big nebulous fears."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.18,
   "end": 124.862,
   "text": "If you go to the thing that is most complicated, that has to be the next step."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.242,
   "end": 126.923,
   "text": "You're never going to advance through it."
  },
  {
   "start": 127.023,
   "end": 128.044,
   "text": "And then you're like."
  },
  {
   "start": 128.545,
   "end": 132.035,
   "text": "amygdala and ego are like, yes, we get to stay the same."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.215,
   "end": 133.98,
   "text": "We don't have to stretch and grow and change."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.883,
   "end": 135.284,
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 135.826,
   "end": 138.533,
   "text": "You're doing the thing that you've envisioned."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.656,
   "end": 141.622,
   "text": "Don't stress what else it needs to be next."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.762,
   "end": 142.384,
   "text": "It will happen."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.525,
   "end": 144.731,
   "text": "Keep following this train and it will take you there."
  },
  {
   "start": 145.814,
   "end": 147.058,
   "text": "Man."
  }
 ],
